 465:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 466:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Reads characters from SEGGER real-time-terminal control block
 467:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    which have been previously stored by the host.
 468:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Do not lock against interrupts and multiple access.
 469:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 470:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 471:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of Down-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
 472:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to buffer provided by target application, to copy characters from RTT-dow
 473:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferSize   Size of the target application buffer.
 474:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 475:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
 476:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes that have been read.
