 755:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** /*********************************************************************
 756:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 757:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *       SEGGER_RTT_WriteNoLock
 758:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 759:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Function description
 760:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Stores a specified number of characters in SEGGER RTT
 761:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    control block which is then read by the host.
 762:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    SEGGER_RTT_WriteNoLock does not lock the application.
 763:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 764:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Parameters
 765:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    BufferIndex  Index of "Up"-buffer to be used (e.g. 0 for "Terminal").
 766:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    pBuffer      Pointer to character array. Does not need to point to a \0 terminated string.
 767:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    NumBytes     Number of bytes to be stored in the SEGGER RTT control block.
ARM GAS  C:\msys64\tmp\ccWAPVkS.s 			page 41


 768:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 769:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Return value
 770:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    Number of bytes which have been stored in the "Up"-buffer.
 771:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *
 772:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *  Notes
 773:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (1) If there is not enough space in the "Up"-buffer, remaining characters of pBuffer are dropp
 774:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *    (2) For performance reasons this function does not call Init()
 775:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        and may only be called after RTT has been initialized.
 776:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** *        Either by calling SEGGER_RTT_Init() or calling another RTT API function first.
 777:ARM_SEGGER_RTT/SEGGER_RTT.c **** */
